  tutorial:
  - clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 8aa6a3de3a3802345afe824aff9e1e38, type: 3}
    TutorialText: 'If there is more than one planet that needs to be delivered. The
      target planet will always be highlighted telling you which one is needed to
      be devliered to first. Once you are close to the planet, the highlight will
      fade away and telling you have succesffuly delivered '
    VideoName: PlanetTutorial1.mp4
  - clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: f32f3d4f621eddf4bb59003407e8b7b9, type: 3}
    TutorialText: 'If the planet has no highlight or you have already delivered the
      goods to the planet. Make sure not to go too close, if you do then the ship
      will land on the planet making it game over. '
    VideoName: PlanetTutorial2.mp4
